WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:11.345
(mysterious piano music)

00:00:12.888 --> 00:00:14.890
- I am honored
to introduce to you,

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:18.101
the creator of the Hunger Games
themselves,

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:20.646
Dean Casca Highbottom.

00:00:24.483 --> 00:00:25.692
- I have summoned you all here

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.403
for the
10th Annual Reaping Ceremony,

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:31.198
in which we choose two
children from each District

00:00:31.198 --> 00:00:32.991
to fight to the death
in the Hunger Games.

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:36.161
- [District 12 Announcer] From
District 12, Lucy Gray Baird.

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:42.417
- There has been
a change this year.

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:44.586
As a Mentor, Mr. Snow,

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:47.923
your role is to turn these
children into spectacles,

00:00:47.923 --> 00:00:49.007
not survivors.

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:53.178
- What does my mentor do
besides bring me roses?

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:55.264
- I do my best
to take care of you.

00:00:55.264 --> 00:00:58.016
- You really wanna take
care of me in that Arena?

00:00:58.016 --> 00:00:59.935
Start by thinking
I can actually win.

00:00:59.935 --> 00:01:03.438
(dramatic orchestral music)

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:04.898
- I'm Lucky Flickerman,

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:07.901
first ever host
of the Hunger Games.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.027
- [Announcer] Enjoy the show.

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:10.279
- [Lucky Flickerman] Five.

00:01:10.279 --> 00:01:11.780
Four.
- [Announcer] Enjoy the show.

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:12.781
- [Lucky Flickerman] Three.

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:14.366
Two.
- [Announcer] Enjoy the show.

00:01:14.366 --> 00:01:15.200
- Run.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.910
(alarm rings)
- [Announcer] Enjoy the show.

00:01:19.538 --> 00:01:20.789
- What happens in there,

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:24.668
fueled with the terror
of becoming prey,

00:01:26.503 --> 00:01:28.463
see how quickly
we become predator?

00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:32.926
See how quickly
civilization disappears?

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:37.889
(dramatic orchestral
music continues)

00:01:37.889 --> 00:01:39.975
- There's a natural
goodness built into us all.

00:01:43.145 --> 00:01:45.439
We can step across
that line into evil,

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:47.733
or not.

00:01:53.071 --> 00:01:54.281
- You hear that, boy?

00:01:55.907 --> 00:01:57.492
It's the sound of snow...

00:01:58.910 --> 00:01:59.995
falling.

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:06.460
- How wonderful that
we all get to be here,

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:09.004
for someone's final performance.

00:02:09.004 --> 00:02:10.255
- It's not just about winning.

00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:11.923
- Everything is about winning.

00:02:13.258 --> 00:02:15.052
- You're monsters,
all of you!

00:02:15.052 --> 00:02:15.886
(Dr. Gaul laughs)

00:02:15.886 --> 00:02:19.723
(dramatic orchestral
music continues)

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:23.602
(officer shouts)
(soldiers grunt)

00:02:30.442 --> 00:02:33.153
- [Snow]
It's the things we love most,

00:02:33.612 --> 00:02:35.155
that destroy us.

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:37.783
(dramatic orchestral
music continues)

00:02:43.205 --> 00:02:47.000
(Rue's Four Note Song plays)

